Subject: [PATCH 256/913] core: lib: scmi-server: update displayed SCP Firmware
 version

SCP Firmware version is 2.16.0. Change the minor version that
is displayed at boot.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 800bdc752591380daec8523ce3a9c70ca3033e6f core: lib: scmi-server: update displayed SCP Firmware version]
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/413581
Change-Id: Ib8f5a2f67a26d0305591fe01da2be32c80afdd28
Signed-off-by: Thomas Bourgoin <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
---
 core/lib/scmi-server/sub.mk | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/core/lib/scmi-server/sub.mk b/core/lib/scmi-server/sub.mk
index 6f28caf0a..a7b7af4a9 100644
--- a/core/lib/scmi-server/sub.mk
+++ b/core/lib/scmi-server/sub.mk
@@ -17,7 +17,7 @@ scpfw-product = optee/$(CFG_SCMI_SCPFW_PRODUCT)
 scpfw-out-path := $(out-dir)/$(libdir)
 
 scpfw-integ-version-maj = 2
-scpfw-integ-version-min = 14
+scpfw-integ-version-min = 16
 scpfw-integ-version-pat = 0
 scpfw-integ-version = $(scpfw-integ-version-maj).$(scpfw-integ-version-min).$(scpfw-integ-version-pat)
 
